          "type": "text",
          "text": "Quality inspectors considered high daytime temperatures while preparing a replacement design for the forest ranger outpost. Rangers assemble the shelter from parts carried on foot. A later inspection will compare the finished dimensions with this record. A closed square-based pyramid has base side 8 m and slant height 13 m on every face. Covering costs $6 per m². Find the total covering cost in dollars."
        }
      ],
      "marks": 4,
      "primary_outcome": "5.6",
      "secondary_outcomes": [],
